fined"}],"\n"]],["$","div",null,{"className":"Briefing_briefing__36Zsb","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Hero_hero__Xm0On","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Hero_heroContent__dHTIW","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","$L18",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Start crafting <em>better</em> briefs"}}]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"$undefined","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Clients love how clear and thorough our briefing template is. So we thought: why keep it to ourselves when we can raise the industry standard? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nA great design brief perfectly aligns all of your project members, from creatives to coders, ensuring everyone is paddling in the same direction. "}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Hero_heroImage__lYtc5","children":["$","$L19",null,{"fill":true,"delay":0.6,"children":["$","$L1a",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/kota-book.png 541w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/kota-book-452x500.png 452w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/06/kota-book.png","mediaDetails":{"width":541,"height":598}},"layout":"contain","lazy":false}]}]}]]}]}],["$","$L1b",null,{"data":{"heading":"Without a solid brief, you risk...","risks":[{"risk":"5","heading":"Expectation misalignment","text":"Without a clear brief, your team might be lost on what’s expected, leading to a final product that misses the mark and wastes resources."},{"risk":"1","heading":"Scope creep","text":"A solid brief sets boundaries, preventing projects from expanding beyond the original intent and avoiding budget and timeline headaches."},{"risk":"2","heading":"Wasted resources","text":"Teams can spend hours on features or designs that don’t align with your goals. A concise brief ensures everyone is on the same page from the start."},{"risk":"3","heading":"Brand inconsistency","text":"Consistency is key. A brief ensures every design element reinforces your brand identity across all channels."},{"risk":"4","heading":"User experience failures","text":"Knowing your audience is crucial. A brief informs the design team about who they’re designing for, ensuring the final product resonates and engages effectively."},{"risk":"6","heading":"Compromised quality","text":"Without a detailed brief, the design might fall short of its potential. Instead of a tailored solution, you might end up with a generic outcome that doesn’t stand out."}]}}],["$","$L1c",null,{"theme":"dark"}],["$","$L11",null,{"scrollTrigger":false,"variation":4,"darkBackground":true}]]}]]
